<Page title="Changelog" heading="Changelog" description="What's new in Folio, version by version." lede="What’s new in Folio.">
  <h2>0.1.0 — search, lock, widgets and memories</h2>
  <p class="caption">November 2026</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Search your whole diary on your iPhone and in the web app, with filters and highlighted matches.</li>
    <li>Lock Folio with Face ID or your passcode.</li>
    <li>Widgets you can tick, Lock Screen widgets, Control Center buttons and Siri shortcuts.</li>
    <li>A mood for each page if you like, On this day, and Year in Pixels.</li>
    <li>Scan paper diary pages, share photos, text and links into Folio, and see your Apple Calendar events beside your days.</li>
    <li>Export any dates as a typeset PDF, or print it.</li>
    <li>Accounts are invite-only for now; the web app installs on your phone.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Website — new look</h2>
  <p class="caption">October 2026</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A new folio.devilsense.com: Features, How it works, Privacy &amp; security, About, FAQ and Download pages.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>0.1.0 — sync, web and the external beta</h2>
  <p class="caption">October 2026</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Sign in with Apple, Google or an email code, and end-to-end encrypted sync between iPhone, iPad and the web.</li>
    <li>Folio on the web at /app, unlocked by scanning a code with your iPhone or with your recovery key.</li>
    <li>Devices list with sign-out, a recovery key, and Delete account in the app and on the web.</li>
    <li>iPad: the calendar and the day side by side. Smoother motion throughout.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>0.1.0 — first TestFlight</h2>
  <p class="caption">October 2026</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Calendar with photo tiles, category dots and task rings; tap a day to see everything on it.</li>
    <li>Write for any day back to 1900 in a half sheet, with formatting, photos and drafts.</li>
    <li>To-do: finished tasks stay on their day, ticked.</li>
    <li>Journal timeline and a wall of every photo.</li>
    <li>Your own categories with colours and symbols.</li>
    <li>On-device dictation, and ✦ for titles, light grammar polish and finding tasks.</li>
    <li>Recently Deleted: anything you delete waits 30 days before it’s gone for good.</li>
    <li>Export everything as JSON and a photos zip.</li>
  </ul>
</Page>
